      "content": "thanks for this. It's a good start, but honestly, it's a bit too dense. developers usually skim everything, so it might get lost in a single block of text.\n\nthe structural score for this draft came back pretty low because there's no hierarchy or breakdown. i know i said not to overdo it, but maybe try to add a bit more organization? maybe use some headers or bullet points to separate the auth, the request, and the errors so people can find what they need faster? just keep it useful, don't make it ridiculous.",
